{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2022-11-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'HPE ASSET UPCYCLING SERVICES CHOSEN BY YAHOO! JAPAN FOR SUSTAINABLE REUSE OF IT ASSETS', 'text': 'TOKYO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT YAHOO! JAPAN HAS CHOSEN HPE ASSET UPCYCLING SERVICES TO ENSURE END-OF-USE HARDWARE GETS REFURBISHED AND REUSED WHEREVER POSSIBLE, TO MEET ITS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS.'}